<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania Sept inflation 0.3 pct, yr/yr 22.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuania Sept inflation 0.3 pct, yr/yr 22.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Lithuania rose to a monthly 0.3 percent in September from August's zero inflation rate, which made for a year-on-year rise in September of 22.3 percent, the statistics department said on Monday.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN CONSUMER PRICES     Sept '96    Aug '96    Sept '95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	    +0.3	  +0.0	 +2.0</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	     +22.3	 +24.3	+35.7</p>
<p> Index (Base Dec 1993=100)     217.9	 217.2	178.2</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
